meta {
  name: saveProductTranslation
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductTranslation",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "language": "nl",
      "product_description": "Mijn product",
      "product_long_description": "Een uitgebreide beschrijving"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Set translated text fields for a product in a specific language. Set add_to_changes=true to queue for review. Returns outcome=applied, queued_for_review (with change_request_id), or no_changes. Review-only clients always queue.

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `add_to_changes` | boolean | no | Queue an update for review instead of publishing |
  | `product_id` | integer | yes | Internal ID of the product |
  | `language` | string | yes | BCP 47 language code (e.g. nl, nl-BE) |
  | `context_id` | integer | no | Channel context ID; defaults to 1 |
  | `product_model` | string (nullable) | no | Model name of the product |
  | `product_variation` | string (nullable) | no | Variation descriptor (e.g. colour, size) |
  | `product_description` | string (nullable) | no | Short product description |
  | `product_long_description` | string (nullable) | no | Extended product description |
  | `product_marketing_text` | string (nullable) | no | Marketing copy for the product |
  | `product_web_text` | string (nullable) | no | Web-facing product text |

  **Example: Set Dutch product name**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductTranslation",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "language": "nl",
      "product_description": "Mijn product",
      "product_long_description": "Een uitgebreide beschrijving"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "language": "nl",
    "context_id": 1,
    "outcome": "applied",
    "change_request_id": null
  }
  ```

  **Example: Propose a product translation**. Only supplied translated fields are proposed. A no-op returns outcome=no_changes and change_request_id=null.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveProductTranslation",
    "params": {
      "product_id": 123,
      "language": "nl",
      "product_description": "Nieuwe omschrijving",
      "add_to_changes": true
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_id": 123,
    "language": "nl",
    "context_id": 1,
    "outcome": "queued_for_review",
    "change_request_id": 42
  }
  ```
}
